{"id":"656591","name":"梅菜焖五花肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656591/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"客家梅菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅菜提前一晚用清水浸泡。","img":"images/656591/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"五花肉洗净改刀切块。","img":"images/656591/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"生姜切片备用。","img":"images/656591/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片翻炒。","img":"images/656591/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入五花肉，煸炒出适量油脂。","img":"images/656591/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量生抽，老抽，蚝油。","img":"images/656591/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/656591/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/656591/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开盖上焖45分钟左右。","img":"images/656591/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"泡好的梅菜洗净切块。","img":"images/656591/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"五花肉焖至软烂后放入梅菜。","img":"images/656591/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"继续焖20分钟左右收汁即可。","img":"images/656591/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656591/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656591/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656591/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}